# decision K8S-VERSION@kubernetes_cluster:prod → pin_minor (default)
# decision K8S-ENDPOINT@kubernetes_cluster:prod → mirror (default)
# decision K8S-PRIVATE-NODES@kubernetes_cluster:prod → private_nodes (default)
# decision K8S-POD-RANGES@kubernetes_cluster:prod → secondary_ranges (default)
# decision K8S-LOGGING@kubernetes_cluster:prod → map_components (default)
